{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31900","headline":"寄山友长孙栖峤 · 贾岛","name":"寄山友长孙栖峤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此时气萧飒，琴院可应关。\n鹤似君无事，风吹雨遍山。\n松生青石上，泉落白云间。\n有径连高顶，心期相与还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31900.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31900","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}